test: With {b} baskets, {f} free throws and {t} three-pointers, and {k} fouls along the way, how many points has the team put on the board?
exam: Determine the aggregate number of points accrued by a basketball player who has successfully converted {b} baskets, {t} three-pointers and {f} free throws.
exam: It is given that a team registers {b} baskets, {t} three-pointers and {f} free throws during the period under consideration. Ascertain the points total thereby accumulated.
exam: Compute the score attributable to {a} in respect of {f.words} free throws, {t.words} three-pointers and {b.words} baskets.
exam: Whereas the official record of a basketball fixture credits a player with {b} baskets, {t} three-pointers and {f} free throws, state the number of points so recorded.
exercise: The commentator called {a}'s game "a learning experience" because {a.his} team lost by {k}, but {a} still scored {b} baskets, {t} three-pointers and {f} free throws. How many points did {a} score?
